# Workspace — environment specifics

> Leadership-specific config: report templates, team output preferences, Gong call scoping, and internal coordination. Read by agents when generating reports, querying across the AISE team, or filtering Gong calls.

## Report Output

`/report` uses a single built-in Artifact layout, consistent across `--customer` and `--aise` modes — there is no external template to configure. It renders inline in chat and, by default, also publishes a designed HTML Artifact via the `Artifact` tool; pass `--chat-only` to suppress the Artifact.

